    <!--
      Three different silences, three different sentences. An empty list of
      moments can mean the analysis never ran, or that the capture is too short
      for anything to stand out against, or that a real analysis found nothing.
      Saying "sua batida seguiu no mesmo ritmo" before we have actually looked
      would be the app inventing a result.
    -->
    <string name="moments_not_looked">Ainda não procurei seus momentos nesta noite.</string>
